From: mochiOS developers
Subject: [PATCH] drm/i915: isolate initial commit from PXP and HDCP setup

Final display probe no longer reaches its diagnostic report. Stop after
PXP and HDCP component setup, before entering the initial atomic commit,
to distinguish component setup from modeset waits without adding a timer.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_display_driver.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/i915/display/intel_display_driver.c
@@ -513,6 +513,8 @@
 	 * happen during gem/ggtt init.
 	 */
 	intel_hdcp_component_init(i915);
+	mboot_gpu_probe_trace(i915->drm.dev, "i915-stop",
+			      "PXP HDCP RETURNED BEFORE INITIAL COMMIT", 0);
 
 	/*
 	 * Force all active planes to recompute their states. So that on

